# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (Unicode U+2014) in anything you write for this repo:

- UI copy, placeholders, titles, tooltips, aria-labels
- Code comments and docstrings
- Docs, ADRs, issue/PR/commit text
- Cursor rules and agent instructions (except naming the forbidden character once)

## Prefer

| Instead of em dash | Use |
|---|---|
| clause [em dash] clause | clause: clause |
| clause [em dash] clause | clause - clause (ASCII hyphen-minus) |
| clause [em dash] clause | clause; clause / two sentences |
| Title [em dash] Hatchery | Title - Hatchery |

```
❌ Nest counts and last validated [em dash] coming soon.
✅ Nest counts and last validated (coming soon).
✅ Coming soon: Nest counts and last validated.

❌ Status-surfaces bus (#282) [em dash] no per-pane setInterval.
✅ Status-surfaces bus (#282): no per-pane setInterval.
```

Do not rewrite unrelated historical em dashes across the tree unless that file is already in scope. New and edited prose must stay em-dash-free.
